[length:03:39]
[ti:Purple Rabbit]
[ar:Aracne ]
[al:Chaotic - Dysfunctional]
[au:Aracnephobia]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:15.09]Laugh first.
[00:16.35]Bite first.
[00:17.28]Leave first.
[00:18.45]Never let them see
[00:20.73]what the joke is hiding.
[00:24.44]Need is weakness.
[00:26.73]Love is evidence.
[00:28.98]Anyone who finds it
[00:30.98]must disappear.
[00:33.67]You painted teeth across your face
[00:35.81]and called the terror charm,
[00:37.81]turned every open pair of hands
[00:39.43]into another arm to harm.
[00:42.68]You made a toy of everyone
[00:44.25]before they felt too real,
[00:46.63]because an object cannot leave
[00:48.91]and objects never make you feel.
[00:51.34]If I laugh before you laugh,
[00:52.96]you cannot make me small.
[00:55.66]If I push before you leave,
[00:57.84]I never lost at all.
[01:00.14]If I make you something small
[01:02.31]I can mock, control and move,
[01:04.60]I never have to say
[01:06.68]I was scared to lose you.
[01:10.28]Every joke became a lock.
[01:12.00]Every lock became a wall.
[01:14.45]Every wall became a kingdom
[01:16.25]with no living thing at all.
[01:19.25]Purple rabbit, purple rabbit,
[01:21.21]laugh, laugh, laugh.
[01:23.66]Purple rabbit, purple rabbit,
[01:25.65]bite, bite, bite.
[01:27.98]Laugh first.
[01:28.90]Bite first.
[01:30.14]Leave first.
[01:31.12]Never let them get inside.
[01:37.51]Purple rabbit
[01:38.47]Purple rabbit,
[01:39.03]love became a crime.
[01:41.54]Laugh first.
[01:42.51]Bite first.
[01:43.31]Leave first.
[01:44.04]Leave them
[01:44.63]before they leave you behind.
[01:50.13]Laugh first.
[01:51.20]Bite first.
[01:52.27]Leave first.
[01:53.57]You were never invulnerable.
[01:57.72]You were only
[02:00.82]out of reach.
[02:04.38]The frog was real.
[02:05.23]The grief was real.
[02:05.95]The things you said were true.
[02:08.29]The bonds you buried under jokes
[02:10.06]were living parts of you.
[02:13.02]The damage did not disappear
[02:14.52]because the world looked fake.
[02:16.95]Every heart you called a puppet
[02:18.96]was a heart that you could break.
[02:21.54]You feared that they would leave you,
[02:23.43]so you made it hard to stay.
[02:26.16]You feared that you would hurt them,
[02:27.75]so you hurt them anyway.
[02:30.82]You feared they might discover
[02:32.24]someone frightened underneath,
[02:35.27]so you fed them the caricature
[02:37.56]and sharpened all its teeth.
[02:40.36]You made a courtroom of your chest.
[02:42.75]You made yourself the law.
[02:45.08]You sentenced every witness
[02:47.00]who could name the fear they saw.
[02:50.05]Purple rabbit, purple rabbit,
[02:51.92]laugh, laugh, laugh.
[02:54.61]Purple rabbit, purple rabbit,
[02:56.48]bite, bite, bite.
[02:58.67]Laugh first.
[02:59.65]Bite first.
[03:00.68]Leave first
[03:02.11]Love became a crime.
[03:05.63]before they leave you be-
