[03:25.86]Love became a crime
[03:27.09]Laugh first.
[03:28.20]Bite first. 
[03:29.48]before they leave you behind.
[03:31.52]Laugh first.
[03:32.80]Bite first. 
[03:34.18]You were never invulnerable
